      "source_assumptions": [
        "Proportions from UP018 row measurements (f_measure_up018.py); battlescape PCK is the silhouette / colour authority.",
        "Skin = battlescape mauve-pink ramp (mid #8e5266); cape rust #82360f with a darker red yoke and gold piping.",
        "Anti-grav unit colour: dark violet metal #4e3a64, between the sprite bulb (dark mauve) and UP018 (indigo) - open for review.",
        "The life-support tube telescopes: lower sleeve rigid with the ball, upper rod rigid with spine_02.",
        "Ear-spurs read as long drooping pointed ears (UP018 / UP019); teeth as a lipless grey-green row.",
        "Hands: thumb + three clawed fingers (inference; the art shows long curled claws).",
        "Bind pose = the UP018 stance (arms down, elbows out), so the yoke and cape are built around it.",
        "Idle / Hit / armed holds authored (routine 1 has none); Walk is a hovering glide with no bob (sprite yoffWalk 0).",
        "Death: lead-in (sprites 64-65) hands off to the ragdoll; impulse along the attack direction; DeathBaked as fallback.",
        "Unseen back / sides inferred from facings 5-7 and the walk frames (UP018 has no back view)."
      ],
